LearnLoop samples: third-party sources redistributed under their own licences
============================================================================

The files in this directory are not LearnLoop's own work and are NOT covered by
the repository's Apache-2.0 licence. Each is redistributed unmodified under
the licence named in its entry, which was checked against the licensor's own
statement (docs/specs/spec_storage_sync_v1.md §3.5, decision D16). They are
here so that a new contributor can try LearnLoop on real material: add one to
a vault with Add (or `learnloop add-source`).

Two entries are licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL use only (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). Whoever
redistributes this repository commercially must remove them; the code does not
need them, and the test suite never reads this directory.

Every file under samples/ must have an entry here naming its licence
(tests/test_public_tip_guards.py checks it).


